{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"lines-of-action UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"lines-of-action.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["lines-of-action.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Ini mengikuti deskripsi aturan ZXQPH0000QXZ×ZXQPH0001QXZ dari International Computer Games Association: dua belas bilah per sisi, hitungan garis penuh yang tepat, berdekatan diagonal untuk koneksi, melewati ketika tidak dapat bergerak, dan draw pada posisi ketiga yang diulang. Varian yang dipublikasikan berbeda pada koneksi simultan; pilih aturan yang Anda sukai. Tantangan komputer menggunakan heuristik lokal kecil dan bukan mesin turnamen.","record_id":"ff2ebac74a08a205fcf8e60f7b1c2dee67dee1e17d71ac790692794bb1552748","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.283956529999955,"source":"This follows the International Computer Games Association’s 8×8 rule description: twelve pieces per side, exact full-line counts, diagonal adjacency for connection, passing when unable to move, and a draw on a third repeated position. A published variant differs on simultaneous connections; select the rule you prefer. The computer opponent uses a small local heuristic and is not a tournament engine.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"09b37b643e7a02924e95e8009e90c8027ced5eda7adb57dae972f935a23258d0","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Ini mengikuti deskripsi aturan 8×8 dari International Computer Games Association: dua belas bilah per sisi, hitungan garis penuh yang tepat, berdekatan diagonal untuk koneksi, melewati ketika tidak dapat bergerak, dan draw pada posisi ketiga yang diulang. Varian yang dipublikasikan berbeda pada koneksi s